<title>Turkmenistan: Turkmenistan March gas output plunges to 2.69 bcm.</title>
<headline>Turkmenistan March gas output plunges to 2.69 bcm.</headline>
<dateline>ASHGABAT 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkmenistan's production of natural gas fell in March to 2.69 billion cubic metres from 3.59 billion cubic metres in February, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The committee released the following figures for energy output in its latest monthly statistical bulletin. Figures in tonnes, except natural gas in billion cubic meters.</p>
<p> TURKMEN ENERGY OUTPUT	Mar 97     Feb 97	Jan-Mar 97</p>
<p> Natural gas		     2.689	  3.588	10.089</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	 -25.0	   -5.9	   n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	   n/a	    n/a	 -11.4</p>
<p> Crude oil		     338,300	296,200     964,500</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	 +14.2	  -10.2	   n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	   n/a	    n/a	  +0.4</p>
<p> Gasoline			 42,100	 39,500	20,400</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	  +6.6	   +1.8	   n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	   n/a	    n/a	 -41.1</p>
<p> Diesel			  114,300	 92,100     303,400</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	 +24.1	   -5.1	   n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	   n/a	    n/a	  -9.2</p>
<p> Fuel oil			163,600	134,400     438,300</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change	 +21.7	   -4.2	   n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change	   n/a	    n/a	  +0.6</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom +7 3272 509410</p>
